# Social profiles and reactions, topics and world reactions for the six Enhanced villagers.

social marcus
  loves advice
  likes joke, compliment
  dislikes tease

dialogue social.marcus.joke.great
n0 marcus: Hm. A good one. I'll tell it at the bench. Bram will say nothing. It'll be perfect.
  expr happy

dialogue social.marcus.joke.good
n0 marcus: Ha. That's funny. Dry, like good timber.

dialogue social.marcus.joke.flop
n0 marcus: A joke? ...Ah. I was measuring. Say it again, slower.
  emote sweat

dialogue social.marcus.compliment.great
n0 marcus: That's kind. I'll carry it around for a week. Like a good pencil.
  expr happy

dialogue social.marcus.compliment.good
n0 marcus: Thank you. I'll note it. Quietly.

dialogue social.marcus.compliment.flop
n0 marcus: Oh. Hm. That's a lot of weather for one sentence.
  emote sweat

dialogue social.marcus.advice.great
n0 marcus: Advice? Gladly. Never rush a cut. Never cut in anger. Never throw away the offcut.
  expr happy

dialogue social.marcus.advice.good
n0 marcus: My advice: measure twice. Then ask someone else to measure once.

dialogue social.marcus.advice.flop
n0 marcus: Advice? From me? I mostly say 'Measure twice'. I'll see what else is there.
  emote sweat

dialogue social.marcus.tease.great
n0 marcus: Ha. Cheeky. A crooked joke on a straight board. I'll allow it.
  expr happy

dialogue social.marcus.tease.good
n0 marcus: Hm. Funny. A very small chisel to the ribs.

dialogue social.marcus.tease.flop
n0 marcus: Teasing? In my shop? ...I'll take it as affection. Cautiously.
  emote sweat

social odalys
  loves advice
  likes joke, tease
  dislikes compliment

dialogue social.odalys.joke.great
n0 odalys: A joke. Clinical timing, good delivery. I may prescribe it to a patient.
  expr happy

dialogue social.odalys.joke.good
n0 odalys: Ha. Dry. I approve. The laugh is medicinal.

dialogue social.odalys.joke.flop
n0 odalys: Was that a joke? ...Oh. Yes. I was reading a chart. Do continue.
  emote sweat

dialogue social.odalys.compliment.great
n0 odalys: A compliment. How unusual. I'll have to take my pulse.
  expr happy

dialogue social.odalys.compliment.good
n0 odalys: Thank you. I'll file it under 'Unexpected'.

dialogue social.odalys.compliment.flop
n0 odalys: Oh. Hm. That's... kind. I'm not sure where to put my hands.
  emote sweat

dialogue social.odalys.advice.great
n0 odalys: Advice? Ask. Sleep eight hours, eat a vegetable, and call me if your ears itch.
  expr happy

dialogue social.odalys.advice.good
n0 odalys: My advice: soup, sleep and silence. In that order.

dialogue social.odalys.advice.flop
n0 odalys: Advice from me? I'll prescribe a nap. It's the only thing I know for certain.
  emote sweat

dialogue social.odalys.tease.great
n0 odalys: Ha! Cheeky. I'll note the tone. And the posture. It's excellent.
  expr happy

dialogue social.odalys.tease.good
n0 odalys: Hm. Clever. A diagnosis I'll consider.

dialogue social.odalys.tease.flop
n0 odalys: Teasing a doctor? Bold. ...I'll prescribe you a very long lecture.
  emote sweat

social felix
  loves joke
  likes compliment, tease
  dislikes advice

dialogue social.felix.joke.great
n0 felix: Ha! That's a good one. I'll steal it for the next story. It'll grow.
  expr happy

dialogue social.felix.joke.good
n0 felix: Ha. That's the right size of funny. Nets, not trawlers.

dialogue social.felix.joke.flop
n0 felix: A joke? ...Ah. I was watching a float. Say it again.
  emote sweat

dialogue social.felix.compliment.great
n0 felix: That's kind. I'll tell the fish. They'll be unmoved.
  expr happy

dialogue social.felix.compliment.good
n0 felix: Thank you. It's a good line. I'll cast it later.

dialogue social.felix.compliment.flop
n0 felix: Oh. Hm. A bit much for a man in rubber boots.
  emote sweat

dialogue social.felix.advice.great
n0 felix: Advice? Gladly. Patience, bait and a good hat. In reverse order, if it's raining.
  expr happy

dialogue social.felix.advice.good
n0 felix: My advice: sit. Then sit some more. Then catch something, maybe.

dialogue social.felix.advice.flop
n0 felix: Advice? From me? I say 'wait'. It seems to work.
  emote sweat

dialogue social.felix.tease.great
n0 felix: Ha! Cheeky. A fine one. This big. Bigger now.
  expr happy

dialogue social.felix.tease.good
n0 felix: Hm. A bit of bait on the hook. I like it.

dialogue social.felix.tease.flop
n0 felix: Teasing? ...I'll let that go. Like a small fish.
  emote sweat

social dorian
  loves advice
  likes compliment, joke
  dislikes tease

dialogue social.dorian.joke.great
n0 dorian: ...Ha. That was good. I'll tell the moss. It'll say nothing.
  expr happy

dialogue social.dorian.joke.good
n0 dorian: Ha. Quiet laugh. Good one.

dialogue social.dorian.joke.flop
n0 dorian: A joke? ...Oh. I was listening to a bird. Again?
  emote sweat

dialogue social.dorian.compliment.great
n0 dorian: ...Thank you. I'll keep that. In my pocket. With the mushroom.
  expr happy

dialogue social.dorian.compliment.good
n0 dorian: Oh. Thank you. It's quiet. I like it.

dialogue social.dorian.compliment.flop
n0 dorian: Hm. That's a lot of words at once.
  emote sweat

dialogue social.dorian.advice.great
n0 dorian: Advice? Look under old roots. Walk slowly. Don't talk to mushrooms. They're shy.
  expr happy

dialogue social.dorian.advice.good
n0 dorian: My advice: stay quiet. It's all there is.

dialogue social.dorian.advice.flop
n0 dorian: Advice from me? ...I mostly stand very still. It works.
  emote sweat

dialogue social.dorian.tease.great
n0 dorian: ...Ha. I'd say something back. I'm thinking. I'll tell you in the spring.
  expr happy

dialogue social.dorian.tease.good
n0 dorian: Hm. Small, sharp, fair.

dialogue social.dorian.tease.flop
n0 dorian: Teasing? ...I'll go and look at a tree.
  emote sweat

social elara
  loves joke
  likes tease, compliment
  dislikes advice

dialogue social.elara.joke.great
n0 elara: Ha! Oh, that's a good one! I'm using it on Dr. Penn. She'll frown, then smile!
  expr happy

dialogue social.elara.joke.good
n0 elara: Ha! Funny! I'll put it on the waiting room wall!

dialogue social.elara.joke.flop
n0 elara: Wait, was that a joke? ...Oh! Ha! Sorry! I was counting stitches.
  emote sweat

dialogue social.elara.compliment.great
n0 elara: Oh, you're too kind! I'm blushing in two colors of wool!
  expr happy

dialogue social.elara.compliment.good
n0 elara: Aw, thank you! That's very sweet!

dialogue social.elara.compliment.flop
n0 elara: Oh! Er. Thanks! I wasn't ready. I'm holding a needle. It's awkward.
  emote sweat

dialogue social.elara.advice.great
n0 elara: Advice! I love advice! Keep your socks on. Sleep. Don't tell Dr. Penn I said it.
  expr happy

dialogue social.elara.advice.good
n0 elara: My advice: laugh, rest, knit. In any order.

dialogue social.elara.advice.flop
n0 elara: Advice? Hm. I'd rather find out by getting it wrong. It's how I learned everything.
  emote sweat

dialogue social.elara.tease.great
n0 elara: Oh, you wicked thing! I love it! I'll knit you a very small, very pointed hat!
  expr happy

dialogue social.elara.tease.good
n0 elara: Ha! Cheeky! I'll get you back with a very long scarf!

dialogue social.elara.tease.flop
n0 elara: Teasing? ...Hm. I'll decide if it was funny later. With tea.
  emote sweat

social ione
  loves advice
  likes joke, compliment
  dislikes tease

dialogue social.ione.joke.great
n0 ione: Oh. That's lovely. I'll file it under 'Humor, Gentle'. Right next to poetry.
  expr happy

dialogue social.ione.joke.good
n0 ione: Ha. Quiet and clever. Like a good footnote.

dialogue social.ione.joke.flop
n0 ione: Was that a joke? ...Oh. I was reading the last line. Again, please.
  emote sweat

dialogue social.ione.compliment.great
n0 ione: Thank you. That's the kindest line I've heard all day. I'll set it aside.
  expr happy

dialogue social.ione.compliment.good
n0 ione: Oh. That's kind. I'll remember it.

dialogue social.ione.compliment.flop
n0 ione: Oh. Hm. That's a lot of warmth for a quiet room.
  emote sweat

dialogue social.ione.advice.great
n0 ione: Advice? I'd suggest reading the first page and the last. Then deciding if you care.
  expr happy

dialogue social.ione.advice.good
n0 ione: My advice: a good book, a warm lamp, and no hurry.

dialogue social.ione.advice.flop
n0 ione: Advice? I mostly recommend books. It's usually the same thing.
  emote sweat

dialogue social.ione.tease.great
n0 ione: Oh, you wicked reader! I'll set aside a very dull book for you.
  expr happy

dialogue social.ione.tease.good
n0 ione: Hm. Gentle. A footnote with teeth.

dialogue social.ione.tease.flop
n0 ione: Teasing the librarian? ...I'll keep that in mind, quietly, in the margins.
  emote sweat

topic marcus.joinery
  npc marcus
  label Ask about a good joint
  plays marcus.joinery.d
  if hearts:marcus>=1
  priority 2
  cooldown 3

dialogue marcus.joinery.d
n0 marcus: A good joint? Two pieces that agree. No nails, no glue, just patience.
  emote note
  next n1
n1 marcus: It takes a year to learn. I learned it in two. Don't tell my father.
  tag funny

topic odalys.remedies
  npc odalys
  label Ask for a remedy
  plays odalys.remedies.d
  if hearts:odalys>=1
  priority 2
  cooldown 3

dialogue odalys.remedies.d
n0 odalys: A remedy? One bowl of soup, one hour of sunshine, and an unreasonable amount of cheese.
  emote note
  next n1
n1 odalys: Repeat as needed. Doctor's orders.
  tag funny

topic felix.tide
  npc felix
  label Ask about the tide
  plays felix.tide.d
  if hearts:felix>=1
  priority 2
  cooldown 3

dialogue felix.tide.d
n0 felix: The tide? In at six, out at noon. A fish this big comes at four.
  emote note
  next n1
n1 felix: Don't write that down. I'll deny it.
  tag funny

topic dorian.mushrooms
  npc dorian
  label Ask about mushrooms
  plays dorian.mushrooms.d
  if hearts:dorian>=1
  priority 2
  cooldown 3

dialogue dorian.mushrooms.d
n0 dorian: Mushrooms. Gills, caps, rings. Don't eat the shy ones.
  emote note
  next n1
n1 dorian: Check under the oak leaves. Few do.
  tag funny

topic elara.knitting
  npc elara
  label Ask what she's knitting
  plays elara.knitting.d
  if hearts:elara>=1
  priority 2
  cooldown 3

dialogue elara.knitting.d
n0 elara: A scarf! Or a blanket. Or a very ambitious sock. It changes by the hour!
  emote note
  next n1
n1 elara: I'll finish it by spring. Or summer. It's a scarf with ambitions.
  tag funny

topic ione.book
  npc ione
  label Ask for a book
  plays ione.book.d
  if hearts:ione>=1
  priority 2
  cooldown 3

dialogue ione.book.d
n0 ione: A book? I set something aside for you. It's small and a little odd.
  emote note
  next n1
n1 ione: You'll like it. It's about someone who read a lot and learned to listen.
  tag funny

reaction react.marcus.fall
on season:fall
npcs marcus
ttl 5
plays react.marcus.fall.d
say react.marcus.fall.d marcus: Fall. The oak's in and the coops need roofs. I've cleared the bench and a calendar.

reaction react.marcus.harvest
on quest.done:tut_harvest
npcs marcus
ttl 5
plays react.marcus.harvest.d
say react.marcus.harvest.d marcus: First harvest. A good crop wants a good shed. Come by when you're ready.

reaction react.marcus.bram
on event:bram_heart4
npcs marcus
ttl 5
plays react.marcus.bram.d
say react.marcus.bram.d marcus: Bram fixed a repair and said 'Good enough'. It's the longest sentence he's said in a week.

reaction react.odalys.winter
on season:winter
npcs odalys
ttl 5
plays react.odalys.winter.d
say react.odalys.winter.d odalys: Winter. Chilblains, coughs and gloves. Wear all three of the last. Doctor's orders.

reaction react.odalys.harvest
on quest.done:tut_harvest
npcs odalys
ttl 5
plays react.odalys.harvest.d
say react.odalys.harvest.d odalys: A first harvest. Wash your hands before you eat it. Then eat it. Enthusiastically.

reaction react.odalys.skill
on skill.up:farming
npcs odalys
ttl 5
plays react.odalys.skill.d
say react.odalys.skill.d odalys: Your farming has improved. The village's health improves with it. I'll note it in the ledger.

reaction react.felix.summer
on season:summer
npcs felix
ttl 5
plays react.felix.summer.d
say react.felix.summer.d felix: Summer's come. The beach is full of people who think fish come when called.

reaction react.felix.harvest
on quest.done:tut_harvest
npcs felix
ttl 5
plays react.felix.harvest.d
say react.felix.harvest.d felix: A first harvest! Fine. Now try fishing. It's the same, with more waiting.

reaction react.felix.skill
on skill.up:fishing
npcs felix
ttl 5
plays react.felix.skill.d
say react.felix.skill.d felix: Your fishing's getting better. The pond noticed. So did I. You should've seen the other one.

reaction react.dorian.fall
on season:fall
npcs dorian
ttl 5
plays react.dorian.fall.d
say react.dorian.fall.d dorian: Fall. The best mushrooms. I'll show you. Not today. Soon.

reaction react.dorian.harvest
on quest.done:tut_harvest
npcs dorian
ttl 5
plays react.dorian.harvest.d
say react.dorian.harvest.d dorian: First harvest. Hm. Good. The soil likes you.

reaction react.dorian.skill
on skill.up:foraging
npcs dorian
ttl 5
plays react.dorian.skill.d
say react.dorian.skill.d dorian: You forage well now. I saw. A mushroom was on your step. Not me. The forest.

reaction react.elara.spring
on season:spring
npcs elara
ttl 5
plays react.elara.spring.d
say react.elara.spring.d elara: Spring! Sneezes, sprains and optimism. I've put the kettle on for all of them!

reaction react.elara.harvest
on quest.done:tut_harvest
npcs elara
ttl 5
plays react.elara.harvest.d
say react.elara.harvest.d elara: Your first harvest! I'm knitting a very small basket cozy. For luck.

reaction react.elara.skill
on skill.up:farming
npcs elara
ttl 5
plays react.elara.skill.d
say react.elara.skill.d elara: Your farming's improving! I can tell by the callouses. Keep your socks on, hands and feet!

reaction react.ione.winter
on season:winter
npcs ione
ttl 5
plays react.ione.winter.d
say react.ione.winter.d ione: Winter. I've set aside a very long book. It's yours, if the snow stays.

reaction react.ione.harvest
on quest.done:tut_harvest
npcs ione
ttl 5
plays react.ione.harvest.d
say react.ione.harvest.d ione: A first harvest. I've a book on preserving. It's mostly poetry. You'll love it.

reaction react.ione.skill
on skill.up:foraging
npcs ione
ttl 5
plays react.ione.skill.d
say react.ione.skill.d ione: You forage well. I set aside a field guide. It has lovely drawings of mushrooms. Dorian helped.
